# Apple signing material. An App Store Connect API key (.p8) is a credential
# that can publish and read sales data, and it cannot be re-downloaded — it
# belongs outside this repository, in the keychain or a password manager.
# These patterns are a backstop, not permission to keep one here.
*.p8
*.p12
# Android signing keystores. `eas credentials -p android` downloads one into the
